From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] lzma: build LzmaTools for SPL_LZMA

LzmaTools.c is guarded by CONFIG_LZMA, so an SPL with SPL_LZMA but a
U-Boot proper without LZMA links no lzmaBuffToBuffDecompress(). Use
CONFIG_IS_ENABLED(), as lib/Makefile does for the directory.

diff --git a/lib/lzma/LzmaTools.c b/lib/lzma/LzmaTools.c
index 28c42d72..fc2110aa 100644
--- a/lib/lzma/LzmaTools.c
+++ b/lib/lzma/LzmaTools.c
@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@
 #include <log.h>
 #include <watchdog.h>
 
-#ifdef CONFIG_LZMA
+#if CONFIG_IS_ENABLED(LZMA)
 
 #define LZMA_PROPERTIES_OFFSET 0
 #define LZMA_SIZE_OFFSET       LZMA_PROPS_SIZE
